{#
  BeMart admin Order list — EC-CUBE goOrderList (受注一覧).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Order/index.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Order/index.twig).

  Order section, DATA/LIST + search-form page. It extends the admin
  frame (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin
  `default_frame.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup
  skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from
  EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound to the OrderList
  resource body (src/Resource/Page/Admin/OrderList.php — body carries
  `orders` (a list of {orderNo, customerId, total, paymentTotal,
  orderDate, orderStatus}), `count`, `limit`, `offset` and an
  AdminOrderSearchForm exposed as `searchForm`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route, params)` / `canonical-path ...)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `form_widget(searchForm.multi)` -> `searchForm.input('multi')` — the
     real AdminOrderSearchForm keyword box (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - The detail-search panel's `form_widget(searchForm.<field>)` calls
     (orderer name / kana / company, payment-method, order-status
     checkboxes, the four date ranges, email / phone / order-no /
     tracking-number / purchase-product / purchase-price / shipping-mail)
     -> the OrderList resource supports ONLY pagination knobs (Wave 7
     first iteration — see OrderList's docblock; the search axes are
     Phase 2). AdminOrderSearchForm declares only `multi`, so those
     widgets render EMPTY. The panel STRUCTURE (rows / labels / collapse)
     is kept verbatim; the empty widgets are an enumerated residual.
   - `{% for Order in pagination %}` -> the resource body's `orders`
     list. EC-CUBE's `pagination` is a KnpPaginator; the list endpoint
     returns the full collection (no server-side paging in scope), so the
     `pageMaxis` page-count <select> + the `@admin/pager.twig` block are
     OMITTED. Enumerated as residual.
   - EC-CUBE's table iterates `{% for Shipping in Order.Shippings %}` —
     ONE row per shipment, keyed by `Shipping.id`. The AdminOrderListFetched
     projection (Wave 7 shallow admin grid) does NOT carry per-shipment
     rows; it is a flat order projection. BeMart's port renders ONE row
     per ORDER keyed by `orderNo`, dropping the Shipping sub-loop. The
     shipment-scoped columns (出荷状況 / お問い合わせ番号 / お届け先 +
     the per-shipment action icons) therefore render empty / minimal.
     FLAGGED for enrichment follow-up.
   - `Order.name01`/`name02`/`payment_method`/`OrderStatusColor`/
     `OrderStatus`/`payment_date`/`message`/`note`/`is_multiple` -> the
     projection carries a flat `orderNo` / `customerId` / `total` /
     `paymentTotal` / `orderDate` / `orderStatus` (an int). The orderer
     name, payment method, status color/label, payment date and the
     message/note tooltips are NOT carried (Wave 7 shallow-grid slice).
     The cells render the projection value or empty. FLAGGED for
     enrichment follow-up.
   - `csrf_token()` hidden input on the bulk form + `csrf_token_for_anchor()`
     -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront
     ports omit it. EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `OrderStatuses` (the bulk-status <select> options) -> EC-CUBE
     master-data; the OrderList body carries no status master, so the
     <select> renders with only the placeholder option. Enumerated as
     residual.
   - `search_items.twig` include (saved-search chips) -> EC-CUBE admin
     fragment with no BeMart equivalent; dropped (the render-diff loader
     serves it empty).
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-order' %}
{% set title = '受注一覧' %}
{% set sub_title = '受注管理' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $(function() {
            toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '.btn-bulk-wrapper');
            $('input[id^="check_"]').on('change', function() {
                $('#toggle_check_all').prop('checked', false);
                toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '.btn-bulk-wrapper');
            });

            // 登録チェックボックス
            $('#toggle_check_all').on('change', function() {
                var checked = $(this).prop('checked');
                if (checked) {
                    $('input[id^="check_"]').prop('checked', true);
                } else {
                    $('input[id^="check_"]').prop('checked', false);
                }
                toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '.btn-bulk-wrapper');
            });

            $('#btn_bulk_delete').on('click', function(event) {
                event.preventDefault();
                $('#form_bulk').attr('action', "/admin/order/bulk-delete").submit();
                return false;
            });

            // PDF出力(複数)
            $('#bulkExportPdf').on('click', function(event) {
                window.open('', 'newwin', 'toolbar=no, location=no, directories=no, status=no, menubar=no, scrollbars=yes, resizable=yes, width=700, height=700');
                $('#form_bulk').attr('action', "/admin/order/export-order-pdf");
                $('#form_bulk').attr('target', 'newwin');
                $('#form_bulk').submit();
                return false;
            });

            // PDF出力(単一)
            $('.pdf-print').click(function() {
                window.open(this.href, 'newwin', 'toolbar=no, location=no, directories=no, status=no, menubar=no, scrollbars=yes, resizable=yes, width=700, height=700');
                return false;
            });

            // 送り状番号
            var updateTrackingNumber = function(id, url, tracking_number, callback) {
                $.ajax({
                    type: 'POST',
                    url: url,
                    data: {'trackingNumber': tracking_number, 'csrfToken': '{{ csrf_token('admin_order') }}'}
                }).done(function(data, textStatus, jqXHR) {
                    if (data['status'] == 'OK') {
                        $('#tracking_number_' + id).val(data['trackingNumber']);
                        if (typeof callback == 'function') {
                            callback();
                        }
                    } else {
                        alert('Update failed.');
                    }
                    return true;
                }).fail(function(jqXHR, textStatus, errorThrown) {
                    var response = JSON.parse(jqXHR.responseText);
                    var messages = '';
                    for (var i = 0; i < response.messages.length; i++) {
                        messages += response.messages[i] + "\n";
                    }
                    alert(messages);
                    return false;
                });
            };

            $('button.update_tracking_number').prop('disabled', true);
            // フォームに変更があったら更新ボタンを有効にする
            $('input.update_tracking_number').on('keyup', function(event) {
                var $tracking_number = $(this);
                var $button = $("button[data-target='#" + $tracking_number.attr('id') + "']");
                $button.prop('disabled', false);
                $button.children('i')
                    .removeClass('text-secondary')
                    .addClass('text-success');
            });
            // enter キーで更新し、次のフォームへフォーカスを移動する
            $('input.update_tracking_number').on('keypress', function(event) {
                var $tracking_number = $(this);
                var $button = $("button[data-target='#" + $tracking_number.attr('id') + "']");

                var code = event.which ? event.which : event.keyCode;

                if (code == 13) { // on press to enter
                    var index = $('input.update_tracking_number').index(this);
                    var callback = function() {
                        $button.prop('disabled', true);
                        $button.children('i')
                            .removeClass('text-success')
                            .addClass('text-secondary');
                        $('input.update_tracking_number:gt(' + index + '):first').focus();
                    };
                    updateTrackingNumber($tracking_number.data('shipping_id'), $tracking_number.data('url'), $tracking_number.val(), callback);
                    event.preventDefault();
                }
            });
            // 更新ボタンの制御
            $('button.update_tracking_number').on('click', function(event) {
                event.preventDefault();
                var $button = $(this);
                var $target = $($(this).data('target'));
                var tracking_number = $target.val();
                var callback = function() {
                    $button.prop('disabled', true);
                    $button.children('i')
                        .removeClass('text-success')
                        .addClass('text-secondary');
                };

                updateTrackingNumber($target.data('shipping_id'), $target.data('url'), tracking_number, callback);
            });

            // 完了ボタン
            $('#bulkChangeComplete').on('click', function() {
                location.href = '/admin/order-list?resume=1';
            });

        });
    </script>

